{"id":"c5ae2b1b17a905a7","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-tree11-immediate-extension-relation.md","title":"ZFC Tree11 Immediate Extension Relation","display":"df-zfc-tree11-immediate-extension-relation — ZFC Tree11 Immediate Extension Relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree11-immediate-extension-relation","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree11-immediate-extension-relation"],"display":"df-zfc-tree11-immediate-extension-relation — ZFC Tree11 Immediate Extension Relation","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree11-immediate-extension-relation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree11-immediate-extension-relation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree11-immediate-extension-relation — ZFC Tree11 Immediate Extension Relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c7cf057d5daacec1\" href=\"?note=c7cf057d5daacec1\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,T,R_T\\in V\">\\(R,T,R_T\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (set-coded tree-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (ordered-pair code, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c7cf057d5daacec1\" href=\"?note=c7cf057d5daacec1\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree11ImmediateExtensionRelation}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree11ImmediateExtensionRelation}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}immediate\\text{-}extension\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree11ImmediateExtensionRelation}_S(R,T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists R_T\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nR_T=\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\times T:s\\subseteq t\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,R_T)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall p\\in V\\;\\Bigl(p\\in R\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists s,t\\in T\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S(p,s,t)\n\\land\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in R_T\\land s\\neq t\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{14em}\\land\\neg\\exists u\\in T\\;\n(\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in R_T\\land s\\neq u\n\\land\\langle u,t\\rangle\\in R_T\\land u\\neq t)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}immediate\\text{-}extension\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree11ImmediateExtensionRelation}_S(R,T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists R_T\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nR_T=\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\times T:s\\subseteq t\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,R_T)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall p\\in V\\;\\Bigl(p\\in R\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists s,t\\in T\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S(p,s,t)\n\\land\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in R_T\\land s\\neq t\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{14em}\\land\\neg\\exists u\\in T\\;\n(\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in R_T\\land s\\neq u\n\\land\\langle u,t\\rangle\\in R_T\\land u\\neq t)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The biconditional characterizes every member of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>, so no unrelated non-pair elements can be added to the relation.</li>\n<li>“Immediate” is the cover relation of the set-coded prefix order: no node of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> lies strictly between the two endpoints.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code.md","status":"resolved","id":"c7cf057d5daacec1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (set-coded tree-order predicate, see [[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code.md","status":"resolved","id":"c7cf057d5daacec1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (ordered-pair code, see [[../batch19/58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,T,R_T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree11ImmediateExtensionRelation}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}immediate\\text{-}extension\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree11ImmediateExtensionRelation}_S(R,T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists R_T\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nR_T=\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\times T:s\\subseteq t\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,R_T)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall p\\in V\\;\\Bigl(p\\in R\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists s,t\\in T\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S(p,s,t)\n\\land\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in R_T\\land s\\neq t\\\\\n&\\hspace{14em}\\land\\neg\\exists u\\in T\\;\n(\\langle s,u\\rangle\\in R_T\\land s\\neq u\n\\land\\langle u,t\\rangle\\in R_T\\land u\\neq t)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":1816,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3791","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-tree11-immediate-extension-relation.md|58-df-zfc-tree11-immediate-extension-relation]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d25b709595952a78","c7cf057d5daacec1"]}